MID_SE_Gol_Gat_C: <EDH>
MID_SE_Gol_Gat_C_001: YAAAGH!
MID_SE_Gol_Gat_C_002: Bwahaha! That was barely even a fight. Another\neasy win for me!
MID_SE_Gol_Gat_C_003: Brilliantly done, Goliath. Finished in a single blow.
MID_SE_Gol_Gat_C_004: Oh, you were watching, big shot? Came to see\nthe Butcher stomp the competition?
MID_SE_Gol_Gat_C_005: You attack without hesitation, and your physique\nhas some calling you a giantborn.
MID_SE_Gol_Gat_C_006: Despite this, you honed your muscles so as not to rely\non your size. You are a gladiator's gladiator.
MID_SE_Gol_Gat_C_007: Laying it on thick there, huh? But keep it coming.
MID_SE_Gol_Gat_C_008: Still, the crowd was oddly muted. I'd think a gladiator\nof your caliber would be better appreciated.
MID_SE_Gol_Gat_C_009: Yeah, I usually play the heel. I've been fighting for\na while, but no one cheers for me.
MID_SE_Gol_Gat_C_010: The crowd doesn't get it. They say I'm boring to\nwatch, 'cause all I do is smash stuff.
MID_SE_Gol_Gat_C_011: Don't worry about what they think. They don't have\nan eye for these things.
MID_SE_Gol_Gat_C_012: Those hard-as-stone muscles aren't just good for\nattacking—they're an excellent defense as well.
MID_SE_Gol_Gat_C_013: Only a well-formed blow can pierce that wall.\nYour strength is something to be proud of.
MID_SE_Gol_Gat_C_014: I don't usually get so much praise. It's weird. You're\nalright in a fight yourself.
MID_SE_Gol_Gat_C_015: Dunno if it's raw strength or the style you put on it,\nbut you give 'em a good show!
MID_SE_Gol_Gat_C_016: Hah. If you think I look good out there, I can ask\nfor no finer praise.
MID_SE_Gol_Gat_C_017: "Good" is underselling it! No matter what tricks and\ntraps they throw at you, you're on top of it.
MID_SE_Gol_Gat_C_018: It's like you've been here since birth. I'm proud to\nhave a true gladiator like you in our division!
MID_SE_Gol_Gat_C_019: Haha. Fair enough. I'll take the compliment.
MID_SE_Gol_Gat_C_020: I've put in a lot of hard work trying to blend in here,\nafter all.
MID_SE_Gol_Gat_B: <EDH>
MID_SE_Gol_Gat_B_001: Once you're equipped, you'll be on standby. We'll\nneed three people for each guard-duty shift.
MID_SE_Gol_Gat_B_002: He's a real big shot now. What a scumbag.
MID_SE_Gol_Gat_B_003: Goliath? What's this about me being a scumbag?
MID_SE_Gol_Gat_B_004: You heard me. You've been laughing at me behind\nmy back this whole time.
MID_SE_Gol_Gat_B_005: How I'm just an ex-gladiator, while you're this\nbig-shot general.
MID_SE_Gol_Gat_B_006: Is this about me hiding my identity to gain access\nto the arena?
MID_SE_Gol_Gat_B_007: I wasn't trying to get one over on you. I had to do it\nto assess the king.
MID_SE_Gol_Gat_B_008: That's what our buddy said. That you were above it\nall—probably some kinda soldier.
MID_SE_Gol_Gat_B_009: I remember. His wording aside, he was onto\nsomething. He showed great insight.
MID_SE_Gol_Gat_B_010: The other guys said the same thing. They knew\nsomething was fishy with you.
MID_SE_Gol_Gat_B_011: Did they?
MID_SE_Gol_Gat_B_012: You were good, so everyone's eyes were on you.\nAnd they all agreed you seemed like a noble.
MID_SE_Gol_Gat_B_013: All except me! I'm the only one who thought you\nwere just an average joe!
MID_SE_Gol_Gat_B_014: You sweet-talked me, big shot, but I bet it was all\nlaughs once my back was turned.
MID_SE_Gol_Gat_B_015: Damn, man! I called you a "true gladiator" and\nI meant it! Joke's on me, huh?
MID_SE_Gol_Gat_B_016: Back up. Everybody knew except you?
MID_SE_Gol_Gat_B_017: Huh? Yeah. They thought it was weird that you were\nso educated. Figured you were from a noble family.
MID_SE_Gol_Gat_B_018: And all this time I thought my ruse was a success.
MID_SE_Gol_Gat_B_019: Wh...what's up? Why you looking all sad?
MID_SE_Gol_Gat_B_020: You really didn't know everyone could tell?
MID_SE_Gol_Gat_B_021: It doesn't sting any less to hear it again, but I should\nface facts.
MID_SE_Gol_Gat_B_022: Every single gladiator saw through you. Bwahahaha!\nEgg on your face, big shot!
MID_SE_Gol_Gat_B_023: And you had no idea! That's just as bad as me!
MID_SE_Gol_Gat_B_024: I don't see how that's...no, forget it. It doesn't matter.
MID_SE_Gol_Gat_B_025: Heh heh. Well, at least I know for sure I wasn't the\nbutt of the joke.
MID_SE_Gol_Gat_B_026: Sorry for laying into you, big shot. Next time you\nwanna play gladiator, come to me first.
MID_SE_Gol_Gat_B_027: I'll help you look like the real deal!
MID_SE_Gol_Gat_B_028: Heh. Yeah, you're right. I'll be sure to do that.
MID_SE_Gol_Gat_A: <EDH>
MID_SE_Gol_Gat_A_001: Thought that strategy meeting would never end.\nGave me a headache.
MID_SE_Gol_Gat_A_002: Nothing wrong with that. You were taking the\nplans seriously.
MID_SE_Gol_Gat_A_003: I just never understand what they're talking about\nin there. I feel like a gorilla in a library.
MID_SE_Gol_Gat_A_004: Not easy spending so much time in a place where\nyou don't fit in.
MID_SE_Gol_Gat_A_005: So I got a new appreciation for you playing\ngladiator back then, big shot.
MID_SE_Gol_Gat_A_006: Well, I wasn't as good in the role as I thought.
MID_SE_Gol_Gat_A_007: I understand that life outside the arena is a lot for\nyou to take in.
MID_SE_Gol_Gat_A_008: In the days ahead, you may struggle with proper\nbehavior for a soldier.
MID_SE_Gol_Gat_A_009: If it ever gets too much for you, stay close to me.\nRough manners don't bother me.
MID_SE_Gol_Gat_A_010: You mean that?! Thanks, man.
MID_SE_Gol_Gat_A_011: I ain't too into the idea of working for you, though.
MID_SE_Gol_Gat_A_012: Nah, I aim to follow in Bertrand's footsteps.
MID_SE_Gol_Gat_A_013: Understood. As long as that drives you, don't worry\nabout little things like rank between us.
MID_SE_Gol_Gat_A_014: Though it's a shame I can't have a man like you\nunder me.
MID_SE_Gol_Gat_A_015: After all, you're a gifted fighter. Hard to believe\nanyone wouldn't want you.
MID_SE_Gol_Gat_A_016: You think that much of me?
MID_SE_Gol_Gat_A_017: Gah. I always feel kinda funny when you bust out\nthe compliments.
MID_SE_Gol_Gat_A_018: Do you really think I'm worth having around?
MID_SE_Gol_Gat_A_019: Ahhh. Remember what I said in the arena?\nI appreciate your musculature.
MID_SE_Gol_Gat_A_020: My musk? What the? Oh! You mean my muscles.
MID_SE_Gol_Gat_A_021: If I was going to have a right-hand man, I'd want\nhim to be strong.
MID_SE_Gol_Gat_A_022: Not only is it an ace in the hole for emergencies...\nit gives you something nice to look at.
MID_SE_Gol_Gat_A_023: Eh. Whatever you say, big shot.